  m_Name: Tutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueConstructor
  dialogueScript: "Hey, you finally made it! I was wondering when you were going
    to show...\n\tWhat's up?\n\t\tTired, just got done skating. I think I left my
    drink on the other side of the park, would you be able to grab it for me?\n\t\t\tSure
    thing!\n\t\t\tI suppose...\n\tSorry, I was running late...\n\t\tNo worries, you
    still made it! Hey, I think I left my drink at the other side of the park. Could
    you grab it for me? I just sat down.\n\t\t\tYeah, sure.\n\t\t\tI guess...\t"
